---
// Video demo section — real MC workflow
---

<div class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold">
        Mission Control builds <span class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Mission Control.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Every feature exists because we needed it. Watch a real workflow — from task to auditable PR.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Video embed -->
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-[var(--border)] shadow-2xl shadow-cyan-900/10 aspect-video bg-[var(--bg-tertiary)]">
        <!-- Replace YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID with actual ID -->
        <iframe
          class="w-full h-full"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOUTUBE_VIDEO_ID?rel=0&modestbranding=1"
          title="Mission Control Demo"
          frameborder="0"
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
          allowfullscreen
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Three value props -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] hover:border-[var(--border-hover)] transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--accent-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Intelligent model routing</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Opus for architecture. Sonnet for features. Haiku for boilerplate. The right model for the right task — automatically.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] hover:border-[var(--border-hover)] transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--accent-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Policy gates, not vibes</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Lint, security scan, test coverage, architecture review — every PR passes every gate before a human sees it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] hover:border-[var(--border-hover)] transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[var(--accent-primary)]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Evidence bundles</h3>
        <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Full audit trail on every PR — task spec, agent reasoning, gates passed, review decisions. Compliance-ready out of the box.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
